--TEST--
a property's own declaration highlights nothing where a read of it is two lines below, so this request says no more about an unused member than the reference query does, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class User
{
    public string $na<|>me = "";
}

var $u = new User();
echo $u->name;
--REQUEST--
documentHighlight
--EXPECT--
none
